---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { logo } from '../data/moments';
---

<section class="pod night" aria-labelledby="pod-title">
  <div class="wrap pod__grid">
    <div class="pod__badge">
      <!-- The supplied podcast logo, shown as-is -->
      <Image
        class="sticker pod__logo"
        src={logo}
        alt="Had A Nice Day Podcast Show with Ron LaBeau logo: HANDY in headphones at a microphone, giving a peace sign."
        widths={[360, 600, 900]}
        sizes="(max-width: 860px) 78vw, 36vw"
        format="webp"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="pod__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span class="pod__bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        The podcast
      </p>
      <h2 class="h-lg" id="pod-title">Pull up a chair. <span class="say">Tell us about your day.</span></h2>
      <p class="lede">
        On the Had A Nice Day Podcast Show, Ron sits down with riders, golfers, bakers, runners and neighbors to talk
        about the days they remember and how they made room for them. Expect good stories, a few laughs, and probably
        an idea for your next Saturday.
      </p>
      <ul class="pod__list">
        <li><b>Out there.</b> Long rides, early tee times, back roads, county fairs.</li>
        <li><b>Close to home.</b> Kitchens, porches, back yards and quiet hours.</li>
        <li><b>Making the time.</b> How busy people protect the stuff that matters.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="pod__ctas">
        <a class="btn btn--orange" href="/podcast">Explore the podcast</a>
        <a class="btn btn--light" href="/podcast#be-a-guest">Be a guest</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pod {
    background: var(--ink);
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) var(--section);
  }
  .pod__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .pod__logo {
    width: min(100%, 520px);
    --tilt: -4deg;
  }
  .pod__badge:hover .pod__logo {
    --tilt: 0deg;
  }
  .pod__copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .pod__copy .say {
    display: block;
    color: var(--orange);
  }
  .pod__bars {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3px;
    height: 16px;
  }
  .pod__copy .eyebrow::before {
    display: none;
  }
  .pod__bars i {
    width: 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: currentColor;
    height: 40%;
  }
  .pod__bars i:nth-child(2) {
    height: 100%;
  }
  .pod__bars i:nth-child(3) {
    height: 65%;
  }
  .pod__bars i:nth-child(4) {
    height: 85%;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .pod__bars i {
      animation: bar 1.1s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .pod__bars i:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: -0.4s;
    }
    .pod__bars i:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: -0.8s;
    }
    .pod__bars i:nth-child(4) {
      animation-delay: -0.2s;
    }
    .pod__bars i:nth-child(5) {
      animation-delay: -0.6s;
    }
  }
  @keyframes bar {
    to {
      transform: scaleY(0.45);
    }
  }
  .pod__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(246 239 225 / 0.16);
  }
  .pod__list li {
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--on-night-2);
  }
  .pod__list li + li {
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(246 239 225 / 0.1);
  }
  .pod__list b {
    color: var(--on-night);
  }
  .pod__ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .pod__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .pod__badge {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .pod__logo {
      width: min(78vw, 380px);
    }
  }
</style>
